{
  "id": "explore-recording-rules-two-types",
  "title": "See the two types of recording rule",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Explore the **Rule source** filter to see how the two types of recording rule differ."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "two-types",
      "title": "See the two types of recording rule",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "content": "If you aren't on the **Alert rules** page, click **Alerts & IRM**, then **Alerting**, then **Alert rules** in the main menu.",
          "requirements": ["navmenu-open"],
          "skippable": true,
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "a[data-testid='data-testid Nav menu item'][href='/alerts-and-incidents']",
              "requirements": ["navmenu-open", "exists-reftarget"]
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "a[data-testid='data-testid Nav menu item'][href='/alerting']",
              "requirements": ["navmenu-open", "exists-reftarget"]
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "a[data-testid='data-testid Nav menu item'][href='/alerting/list']",
              "requirements": ["navmenu-open", "exists-reftarget"]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[aria-labelledby='filter-label-rule-type'] button:contains('Recording rule')",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/list",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "In the **Type** filter, select **Recording rule**, if it isn't already selected."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[aria-labelledby='filter-label-rule-source']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/list",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "content": "Find the **Rule source** filter. Its options are **All**, **Grafana managed**, and **Data source managed**."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[aria-labelledby='filter-label-rule-source'] button:contains('Data source managed')",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/list",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "Select **Data source managed**. The list now shows only data source-managed recording rules."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "A data source-managed recording rule can query data sources such as Mimir or Loki."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[aria-labelledby='filter-label-rule-source'] button:contains('Grafana managed')",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/list",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "Select **Grafana managed**. The list now shows only Grafana-managed recording rules."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "A Grafana-managed recording rule can query a wide range of data sources. This type is recommended and is enabled by default in Grafana Cloud."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "A recording rule is either Grafana-managed or data source-managed, and the **Rule source** filter shows one type at a time."
    }
  ]
}
